Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm back.\NSorry I took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:11.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I finished the Impossible Mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.21,0:00:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but there was a lot that I failed to achieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind me burying you here, Master,\Neven if all I have of you is a finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.88,0:00:28.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're all here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was really no need for everyone to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the nine of us are a new team called Lamplight,\Nand we're going to pick up where Inferno left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope you're watching over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.29,0:00:57.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In twenty days, we'll be heading to the Galgad Empire\Nto begin the Impossible Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.29,0:01:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Until then, I'll continue forging you all into proper spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're going to complete this mission,\Nand we're all going to make it back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:07.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...is what he said!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, let's come together as a group\Nand pull out at all the stops to beat Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whaddya say I take point on our next plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'll work, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to start by gathering intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.50,0:02:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I still think
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:55.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,our only shot is to discover where he's\Nvulnerable and blackmail him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.21,0:02:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's a first-rate spy among first-rate spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.33,0:03:00.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our best option is to find some way of detaining him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It'd be quickest if I just used my bombs to\Nblow the whole manor off the map, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's just one thing I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When we attacked him in the bathroom the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,why wasn't the changing room locked properly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, was that directed at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, you were the one in charge of lock duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't look at me.\NI sealed it off with a combination lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:23.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way to open it without the six-digit code.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:25.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least own up to your mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:29.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With how bad the attack squad shat the bed,\NI don't think you're one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:31.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teamwork is the name of the game right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, these'll help you cool off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, financiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.50,0:03:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dang, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.54,0:03:46.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you want seconds, all you have to do\Nis bow down to your glorious leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do agree that we should work on our coordination.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the bonds between us as friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what really matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:54.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, you got anything to add?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All this talk about "bonds" is just platitudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:04:01.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Spies can't afford to give out their trust that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you, uh, want a financier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.79,0:04:05.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.96,0:04:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:37.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to remind them that\Nit's a spy's job to doubt everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They keep talking about friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:46.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I just don't feel that close with them yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:48.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,especially with how I showed up late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And plus, if I get too close to them-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.63,0:04:52.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, hold up a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:57.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looking at those nice clothes you've got,\NI'd say you're a member of the bourgeois.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:05:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mind coming with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.29,0:05:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:04.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can think of it as an act of philanthropy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:08.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, mister,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:10.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,how are we supposed to become friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:13.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now you wanna be my friend, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.83,0:05:29.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can we go this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:39.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just as my whole life has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:40.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I get dragged into them day in and day out...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Accidents, tragedies, calamities...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:48.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What're you muttering about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:50.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it's let me kind of sense them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can tell when and where misfortune will strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Fool,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:05:59.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's time to kill with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are a mess!\NWhat happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll carry out the next attack solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:32.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want the rest of you to help from the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you can handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:36.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We went to the same academy for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so I know the rumors!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:47.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Erna's a really unlucky girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:48.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why she'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.75,0:06:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Unlucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't see what's fine about that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:07:00.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone I knew got into an accident, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.00,0:07:04.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why our friend here got transferred!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:18.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Bad things happen to the people around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,And if they died, it was written off as an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:23.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,The way I specialize in accidents and misfortune
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:25.88,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,makes me the perfect assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:32.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:34.17,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm a horrible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:44.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'll overpower Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.58,0:07:48.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Then, everyone will respect me\Nand compliment me and not abandon me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.21,0:07:52.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,This time, I'm going to become\Nproper friends with the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach, what a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily tripped over my paints last night,\Nso I had to replace them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it just you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.79,0:08:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's my turn to go shopping for the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is training\Nto get ready for the next attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:24.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:35.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:37.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I need to keep the conversation going\Nso I can lure him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it you're buying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:41.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On your shopping-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gr-groceries, and soap, and an alarm clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One of the curtains got torn, so a little bit of fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:50.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And if I find something cute,\NI might get a new set of pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a lot to carry on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll come help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.33,0:08:57.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where to first?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.17,0:09:03.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to go to the clothing store on Main Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.83,0:09:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.13,0:09:10.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:14.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,You're about to be struck by misfortune, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:46.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,T-Teach, you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Never better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:49.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I punctured its tire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:52.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it had kept on going like that,\Nit could have killed someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it happened so fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The police can handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:04.63,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:06.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I still smell more misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:07.96,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.71,0:10:26.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, this one got chipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:30.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,He's an actual, factual monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe that's the last item from your list.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But there are still places I want to-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:39.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think this farce has gone on long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The teachers at your academy told me\Nabout your ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:48.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They called you a girl who attracts misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have a predisposition for bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least, that's how I'm referring to it\Nfor the sake of convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No condition that unscientific actually exists,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:11:00.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so perhaps I should call it intropunitive ideation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:04.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I remember hearing about that mansion fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:07.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and about the young girl who was its sole survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The incident made you fixated on the idea\Nthat it was unfair that only you got to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.29,0:11:15.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you seek out punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:20.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your subconscious sniffs out misfortune\Nand guides you towards it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew it, I am a horrible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:33.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,People really misunderstand you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:37.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what's really unlucky:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that a girl with your talents never got\Nthe respect she deserved for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The way I see it, you're the luckiest girl there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.33,0:11:47.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:50.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A lot of people all got saved thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.88,0:11:55.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That runaway car could have hit another pedestrian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:59.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The people on the street could have been\Nsplashed when that stew fell over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:01.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The mad dog could have bitten a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.38,0:12:03.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the bricks could have fallen on that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm bad luck and an ill omen and detestable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:12.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've been spending time with a demon\Nwho drowns people in misfortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I certainly haven't been drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?\NAre you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.71,0:12:22.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:29.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:31.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-it's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.79,0:12:37.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If I tell him, Teach might leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.29,0:12:42.50,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.25,0:12:44.71,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,since it's him...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:54.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach, would you mind following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I assume you're aware, Erna, but we're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:15.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:24.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't move an inch.\NWe've got a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way a councilman's daughter runs away\Nand leaves a constituent to die, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:32.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can play dumb all you want,\Nbut we already know exactly who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:35.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They seem to have us confused for someone else,\Nbut I doubt we can convince them of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.29,0:13:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you take them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.33,0:13:43.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.54,0:13:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The part about them having a hostage is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.13,0:13:50.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll have to just go along with their demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:52.54,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,At least my transmitter is still-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.67,0:14:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're tied up, there are no windows,\Nand the guards are armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.17,0:14:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where's the rest of the team?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were tailing us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My transmitter broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Probably because of my bad luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:23.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really am a horrible person...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.71,0:14:26.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.58,0:14:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.71,0:14:31.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I always bring misfortune to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I drag them in, and they get hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:37.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I should just stay away from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boss is here.\NGet up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:47.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well, we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The man from yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.25,0:14:51.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, I was planning to just run you over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you were behind that runaway car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But then, I heard some interesting info\Nthat made me want to kidnap you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.04,0:15:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.04,0:15:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you let us go right now,\NI'm prepared to overlook all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think you're real tough, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:13.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I dunno if you're some hotshot bodyguard or what,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.17,0:15:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you need to learn when to shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:22.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll give you one more warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.38,0:15:26.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you lay your filthy hands on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.33,0:15:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You just don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.42,0:15:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:35.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wasn't gonna kill you because I heard you'd make\Nfor a good bargaining chip, but screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.42,0:15:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where exactly did you get this nonsensical,\Nwildly-incorrect intel of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:41.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did it come from a teenage girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:48.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a dead man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:49.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was too well-executed to be a mere coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:15:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For a supposed case of mistaken identity,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the countermeasures you used against me\Nwere entirely too effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.71,0:16:10.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:15.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After you failed to run this girl over,\Nyou ran into a silver-haired girl wearing a ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That girl then fed you fake intel on us\Nunder the guise of sharing rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.04,0:16:24.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Believing her, you decided to kidnap us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.33,0:16:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For your hostage, you chose a black-haired girl\Nyou just happened to run across.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:34.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you learned our destination\Nfrom a girl with white hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is any of this ringing a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How could you possibly...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:40.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:44.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In just ten days, you've all improved faster\Nthan I could have ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.25,0:16:49.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These man took their hostage in earnest,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:52.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and when they threatened us, they meant every word.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.25,0:16:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was a brilliant strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-who is this guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What're you babbling about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.96,0:16:58.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This time, you're fuckin' dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.63,0:17:00.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's just one thing I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How much longer should I keep\Nplaying along with this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.79,0:17:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.21,0:17:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you think you can beat me, you're dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.21,0:17:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hit narcotic paydirt, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This will be enough to get them all arrested!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.13,0:17:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You would think that playing the hostage\Nwould be an easy role, but apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Erna.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:59.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You gave us more good fortune than we planned for,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.67,0:18:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so we had to improvise on the fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.67,0:18:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We decided to bet on your ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, I did try to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was like, think of how sad it'll make Erna!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.33,0:18:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Quit tryin' to cover your own ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:15.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should try working together with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lamplight's like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.63,0:18:21.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The kind of misfortune you bring\Nisn't nearly enough to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.38,0:18:22.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's got that right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All right, Teach!\NThis time, we finally caught you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:32.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could have died, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:34.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it would take more than\Na few bullets to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.79,0:18:37.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Five minutes from now, the authorities will be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You already made the call?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.46,0:18:40.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.67,0:18:44.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At this rate, they're gonna haul you away, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:48.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what kind of pathetic spy gets questioned\Nby his own country's police?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you say you surrender, then lick my boots\Nwhile calling me Lily the Great, I guess I could-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:58.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those chains were designed for tying up big game...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.58,0:19:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You aren't qualified to be my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:12.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How the hell did we still lose\Nafter going to lengths like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm bummed out, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:16.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess that's Teach for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.88,0:19:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First the combination lock, now the chains.\NHow does he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.54,0:19:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.83,0:19:25.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The strength it would have taken to\Nbreak through those big game chains...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:27.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know how he was able to destroy the chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:37.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When we got captured, Teach used a jewel he had\Nhidden in his mouth to buy off one of the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.08,0:19:41.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He got the man to damage the chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:46.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, he intentionally provoked the guy in charge\Nto get him to open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:51.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, he used the bullets to hit the weakened sections?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That would be enough to tear through any chains,\Nno matter how robust they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.29,0:19:58.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think he used the same trick to\Nopen the combination lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:20:02.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All he had to do was buy one of us off and\Nget them to tell him the code in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-you mean, one of us is a spy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:08.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're all spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.75,0:20:10.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.63,0:20:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there was one person who always chimed in\Nwhenever the topic of the lock came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:19.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and someone who kept going on\Nabout bonds and trusting each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:23.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lily, I've got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get those financiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:31.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, Teach basically made me do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He said that I needed practice lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and you all needed practice doubting your allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a great leader,\Naccepting her friends' hatred for the good of the team!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:44.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It definitely wasn't the ridiculously-scrumptious\Nsnacks that sealed the deal, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.17,0:20:50.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember that whole thing about how we're spies,\Nand we can't afford to give out our trust so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.96,0:20:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-hem!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:56.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, I just got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:20:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.00,0:21:03.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach, I just snatched up some information\Nyou're gonna want to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.46,0:21:05.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The others wrote out their whole plan.\NHere, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heh, you're wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.92,0:21:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got paint all over my maidenly nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was awesome, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.25,0:21:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.79,0:21:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They treated you like a washout at the academy,\Nbut you're totally awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:21.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I give you my praise, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.58,0:21:26.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.08,0:21:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I don't mind being your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-how unlucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.71,0:23:13.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to get along with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.21,0:23:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.58,0:23:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I still have a lot to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.75,0:23:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you ever going to finish that painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.33,0:23:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a fair question.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.75,0:23:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I bought all this new paint,\Nbut it just isn't speaking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:52.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(371.2,576)}{\an7}20 Days Before the Impossible Mission
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:39.38,Caption-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,165.6)}{\an7}SPY CLASSROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:52.75,Caption-3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(115.2,612)}{\an7}FILE: Fool Erna
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:59.08,Caption-3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.8,136.8)}{\an7}FILE: Fool Erna
